TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution at 100 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        5
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    C(4)      0.5
    Mn        1
RATES
Calcite_diss
-start
10 rate = PARM(1) * PARM(2)
20 moles = rate * TIME
30 SAVE moles
-end
KINETICS 1
Calcite_diss
    -formula  CaCO3 1
    -m0       1
    -m        1
    -parms    10.0 0.001
    -steps    10 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -pH true
END
